|> Exercise
    handle=_construct_signature_reciprocal_

    |> CodexSuggestion
        Can you construct a function of signature $[\s] \ra [\te{kg}]$
        from functions

        $$
        f : [\s] \ra [\m], \qquad g : [\m^{-1}] \ra [\te{kg}]?
        $$

    |> Solution
        |> CodexSuggestion
            Yes: $g \circ (1/f)$, wherever defined, since
            $1/f : [\s] \ra [\m^{-1}]$.
